### Describe the feature you'd like to request

Being able to create middleware with another middleware as a base middleware

### Describe the solution you'd like to see

Either like `.pipe`/`.extend()`/`.use` (or another keyword, idk?)

```ts
const fooMiddleware = t.middleware((opts) => {
  return opts.next({
    ctx: {
      foo: 'foo' as const,
    },
  });
});

const barMiddleware = fooMiddleware.use((opts) => {
  opts.ctx.foo;
  //        ^? -> 'foo'
  return opts.next({
    ctx: {
      bar: 'bar' as const,
    },
  });
});

const proc = t.procedure
  .use(barMiddleware)
  .query(opts => {
     opts.ctx
     //       ^? -> `{ foo: 'foo', 'bar: 'bar', }
  });

```

